# Cardly — marketing site (www.usecardly.app)
#
# There is nothing to set. This site reads no environment variables at all,
# and that is deliberate rather than incidental: it has no Supabase client, no
# session, and nothing to authenticate. Every control that crosses into the
# product is an absolute URL from src/lib/site.ts.
#
# Keeping it that way is what makes this deployment small, fast and safe to
# cache. If a page here ever needs a key, that is the moment to ask whether
# the page belongs on the product host instead.
#
# PORT is supplied by the host (Railway) and read by the start command in
# nixpacks.toml. Do not set it here.
